 Daśāvatār Stotram"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":153,"first_line":"ye ānila prema-dhana","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Viraha-gīti"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ye ānila prema-dhana karuṇā prachura","hena prabhu kothā gelā āchārya ṭhākura"],"translation":["Where has Advaita Āchārya, the Lord who mercifully brought the wealth of divine love to this world, gone?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kā̐hā mora svarūpa rūpa kā̐hā sanātana","kā̐hā dāsa raghunātha patita-pāvana"],"translation":["Where are my Svarūp, Rūpa, and Sanātan? Where is my Raghunāth Dās? Where are the saviours of the fallen souls?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["kā̐hā mora bhaṭṭa-yuga kā̐hā kavirāja","eka-kāle kothā gelā gorā naṭa-rāja"],"translation":["Where are my Raghunāth Bhaṭṭa and Gopāl Bhaṭṭa? Where is my Kṛṣṇadās Kavirāj? Where has the great dancer Śrī Gaurāṅga suddenly gone?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["pāṣāṇe kuṭiba māthā anale paśiba","gaurāṅga guṇera nidhi kothā gele pāba"],"translation":["I will break my head on a rock, I will enter into fire—where shall I go to reach the reservoir of all qualities, Śrī Gaurāṅga?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["se saba saṅgīra saṅge ye kaila vilāsa","se saṅga nā pāñā kānde narottama dāsa"],"translation":["Not finding the association of Śrī Gaurāṅga, who performed His Pastimes with all these associates, Narottam Dās weeps."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/49-ye-anilo-prema-dhana-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-viraha-giti","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-viraha-giti","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/je-anilo-prema-dhana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Viraha-gīti-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/je-anilo-prema-dhana-karuna-prachura/","description":"Viraha-gīti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Viraha-gīti. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"je-anilo-prema-dhana-karuna-prachura"}}